1
00:00:00,988 --> 00:00:04,188
(Raj:)And here's your daddy.

2
00:00:04,192 --> 00:00:06,892
(Raj:)When he tries to tell
you he used to be cool,

3
00:00:06,894 --> 00:00:09,464
(Raj:)you can see he wasn't.

4
00:00:11,833 --> 00:00:14,003
(Raj:)All right,
enough with the camera.

5
00:00:14,001 --> 00:00:16,131
(Raj:)Well, this is not for me.
This is for the baby.

6
00:00:16,137 --> 00:00:18,167
(Raj:)Some day she's gonna
want to see this.

7
00:00:18,172 --> 00:00:20,102
(Bernadette:)I'm sorry.

8
00:00:20,108 --> 00:00:22,438
Who's gonna want to see this?

9
00:00:23,478 --> 00:00:28,378
I... I said “she,”
but lots of things are she--

10
00:00:28,383 --> 00:00:29,613
(Raj:)boats

11
00:00:29,617 --> 00:00:30,787
(Raj:)and cars,

12
00:00:30,785 --> 00:00:33,655
(Raj:)whales.
Like, “Thar she blows.”

13
00:00:35,590 --> 00:00:37,190
(Stuart:)You're doing great.

14
00:00:38,059 --> 00:00:39,929
Raj!

15
00:00:39,927 --> 00:00:41,497
(Raj:)Well, okay,
I'm gonna sign off now.

16
00:00:41,496 --> 00:00:43,966
(Raj:)This next part may contain
some adult language.

17
00:00:43,965 --> 00:00:45,335
How could you?!

18
00:00:45,333 --> 00:00:47,363
(Howard:)We made it this
far without knowing,

19
00:00:47,368 --> 00:00:49,038
and you ruined it!

20
00:00:49,036 --> 00:00:50,636
(Raj:)Well, you guys have no idea
how hard it is

21
00:00:50,638 --> 00:00:52,938
(Raj:)to know something like this
and not say it!

22
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:55,410
(Stuart:)You told me it was a girl,
and I didn't say it.

23
00:00:55,410 --> 00:00:57,080
Raj!
You were supposed

24
00:00:57,078 --> 00:00:58,648
(Raj:)to keep that to yourself.

